68	
69	- **`savedEntryIdFor` is synchronous and does not itself await `_ensureLocalCacheLoaded()`.** It is only ever
70	  called by `ChatBloc._seedBookmarks`, strictly after `listMessages(sessionId)` has already resolved inside
71	  `_loadSession` — and `listMessages()` already awaits `_ensureLocalCacheLoaded()` unconditionally before
72	  returning, in both its success and (post-retry) failure paths. By the time `_seedBookmarks` runs, the map is
73	  therefore guaranteed populated. Calling `savedEntryIdFor` from anywhere that has *not* first awaited one of
74	  `createSession`/`listSessions`/`listMessages` would not have this guarantee — no such call site exists in
75	  this unit.
76	- **`recordMessageSaved` always persists**, even if the in-memory map already happened to contain the same
77	  pair (e.g. a retried save after a lost local record) — a harmless, idempotent overwrite.
78	
79	## Who depends on this
80	
81	`ChatBloc._seedBookmarks`/`_onBookmarkTapped` only (contracts/chat-bloc-bookmark-extension.md) — no other unit
82	yet calls `savedEntryIdFor`/`recordMessageSaved`.
